    "minimum_walkway_width": 1.2,
    "minimum_head_clearance": 2.05
  },
  "generation_rules": [
    "Collision regions are simplified blockers and should be less detailed than the visual mesh.",
    "Regions marked wall or ceiling must block the player but must not be used for ship-world physics contact.",
    "The forward ramp aperture remains open; only its side jambs, lintel, and threshold guard regions may block the player.",
    "Stair and landing guards should prevent accidental falls without blocking either stair lane.",
    "Cockpit canopy collision should preserve the transparent canopy view while preventing the player from clipping through glass or upper frames."
  ],
